{'symbol': 'EPAM', 'date': '2022-11-02 10:02:00', 'title': 'EPAM CONTINUUM RELEASES THIRD ANNUAL CONSUMER BANKING REPORT - REVEALING SHIFTING TRENDS FACING THE BANKING INDUSTRY', 'text': "FROM THOUGHTS ON IN-PERSON BANKING EXPERIENCES TO SKEPTICISM OF CRYPTOCURRENCY AND THE RISE OF EMBEDDED FINANCE, EPAM CONTINUUM UNPACKS CONSUMER INSIGHTS AND ATTITUDES TOWARD RETAIL BANKING PRODUCTS AND SERVICES NEWTOWN, PA. , NOV. 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EPAM CONTINUUM, THE INTEGRATED BUSINESS, TECHNOLOGY AND EXPERIENCE CONSULTING PRACTICE OF EPAM SYSTEMS, INC. (NYSE: EPAM), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE RELEASE OF ITS THIRD ANNUAL CONSUMER BANKING REPORT\xa0— REVEALING HOW CUSTOMERS' EVOLVING ATTITUDES, NEEDS AND EXPECTATIONS ARE RESHAPING THE INDUSTRY AND CHANGING HOW BANKS COMPETE TO DELIVER SERVICES IN AN INCREASINGLY COMPETITIVE MARKETPLACE."}